{
  "name": "Ragfeed: RAG-Pipeline – Webseite zu Chunks, Embeddings, Qdrant",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "07182a3b-0007-4a70-9b07-6f7e8d9c0b01",
      "name": "Start",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "07182a3b-0007-4a70-9b07-6f7e8d9c0b02",
              "name": "url",
              "value": "https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Retrieval-Augmented_Generation",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "07182a3b-0007-4a70-9b07-6f7e8d9c0b03",
      "name": "Adresse",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [220, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.ragfeed.de/v2/scrape",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"url\": \"{{ $json.url }}\",\n  \"formats\": [\n    { \"type\": \"chunks\", \"maxTokens\": 500 }\n  ]\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "07182a3b-0007-4a70-9b07-6f7e8d9c0b04",
      "name": "Ragfeed: Seite in Chunks",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [440, 0],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "ragfeed-header",
          "name": "Ragfeed (Header)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "data.chunks",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "07182a3b-0007-4a70-9b07-6f7e8d9c0b05",
      "name": "Ein Eintrag pro Chunk",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [660, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.openai.com/v1/embeddings",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "openAiApi",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { \"model\": \"text-embedding-3-small\", \"input\": $json.embedText } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "07182a3b-0007-4a70-9b07-6f7e8d9c0b06",
      "name": "Embedding berechnen",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [880, 0],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "openai",
          "name": "OpenAI"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "07182a3b-0007-4a70-9b07-6f7e8d9c0b07",
              "name": "id",
              "value": "={{ $('Ein Eintrag pro Chunk').item.json.id }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "07182a3b-0007-4a70-9b07-6f7e8d9c0b08",
              "name": "vector",
              "value": "={{ $json.data[0].embedding }}",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "07182a3b-0007-4a70-9b07-6f7e8d9c0b09",
              "name": "payload",
              "value": "={{ { \"text\": $('Ein Eintrag pro Chunk').item.json.text, \"heading\": $('Ein Eintrag pro Chunk').item.json.heading, \"metadata\": $('Ein Eintrag pro Chunk').item.json.metadata } }}",
              "type": "object"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "07182a3b-0007-4a70-9b07-6f7e8d9c0b0a",
      "name": "Qdrant-Punkt bauen",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [1100, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "url": "https://IHRE-QDRANT-ADRESSE:6333/collections/ragfeed/points?wait=true",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { \"points\": [ { \"id\": $json.id, \"vector\": $json.vector, \"payload\": $json.payload } ] } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "07182a3b-0007-4a70-9b07-6f7e8d9c0b0b",
      "name": "In Qdrant speichern",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1320, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Komplette RAG-Pipeline, nur mit HTTP-Bausteinen\n\nWebseite → fertige Chunks (Ragfeed) → Embedding (OpenAI) → Vektordatenbank (Qdrant). Nur Bordmittel, keine Zusatz-Knoten.\n\n**Warum stabil gegen Dubletten:** Die `id` jedes Chunks ist eine feste UUID aus Adresse und Position. Sie wird direkt zur Qdrant-Point-ID. Rufen Sie dieselbe Seite erneut ab, überschreibt Qdrant denselben Punkt, statt einen zweiten anzulegen.\n\n**Einrichten:**\n1. **Header Auth** für Ragfeed: Name `Authorization`, Value `Bearer ` + Ihr Schlüssel (`sk-…`).\n2. **OpenAI**-Zugangsdaten im Baustein *Embedding berechnen*.\n3. In *In Qdrant speichern* die Adresse `IHRE-QDRANT-ADRESSE` und die Collection `ragfeed` anpassen. Bei Qdrant Cloud einen Header `api-key` ergänzen.\n\n**Wichtig:** Die Dimension des Embedding-Modells muss zur Qdrant-Collection passen (`text-embedding-3-small` = 1536). Collection vorher mit dieser Größe anlegen.\n\nKosten bei Ragfeed: 1 Credit je Seite, Chunks kosten nichts extra.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "07182a3b-0007-4a70-9b07-6f7e8d9c0b0c",
      "name": "Anleitung",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 180]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
